ayed as a `<system-reminder>` tag in Claude's context at the start of the conversation.\n\nExample output I'm now seeing:\n```\nSessionStart:startup hook success: 📚 You can use the case-study-generator skill to add a case study. Just pass the local directory or the repo URL.\n```\n\nThis provides the project-specific guidance I was looking for. The hook runs and its output becomes visible context that Claude acknowledges.\n\n**However**, the original request for a **user-visible terminal message** (not just context for Claude) may still be valuable for:\n- Showing the message directly in the terminal UI before the conversation starts\n- Providing a more prominent/formatted display (like a welcome banner)\n- Users who want to see the guidance themselves, not just have Claude aware of it\n\nIf the current `SessionStart` hook behavior is the intended solution, this issue could potentially be closed. Otherwise, a dedicated `startupMessage` config for visible terminal output would still be a nice enhancement.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/3831770714/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/3831771843","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/22425#issuecomment-3831771843","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/22425","id":3831771843,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY87kZDLD","user":{"login":"dmccreary","id":674055,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDA1NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/674055?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmccreary","html_url":"https://github.com/dmccreary","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmccreary/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmccreary/following{